# Allowlist: the build context contains ONLY what the Dockerfile copies.
# Everything else (study results and session sheets, tests, scripts, .env files,
# local credentials, git history, legacy prototype, build output) stays out.
*
!package.json
!package-lock.json
!tsconfig.json
!tsconfig.server.json
!vite.config.ts
!src/
!fixtures/synthetic/
!fixtures/devnet/
!THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md
!LICENSE
!NOTICE

# Never, even inside allowed directories.
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.log
**/.DS_Store
